# Keep the build context to source only. Without this file the entire working
# tree is uploaded to the daemon and COPY-ed into the image, which baked the
# real backend/tasks.db (the only copy of the usage stats) and its backups
# into every image built here — and those images get pushed to ACR.

# ── VCS & tooling ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Patterns here are anchored to the context root, unlike .gitignore — a bare
# ".venv/" would miss backend/.venv, which uv creates. Copying that host
# environment in would ship a 300 MB context and let COPY overwrite the
# image's own `uv sync --frozen` result.
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
**/.venv/
**/venv/

# ── Frontend deps & build output (rebuilt inside the image) ──────────
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/.output/
frontend/.nuxt/

# ── Runtime data — never bake stats or user uploads into an image ────
backend/tasks.db*
backend/data/
backend/output/*

# ── Python caches & test scaffolding ─────────────────────────────────
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
backend/tests/
backend/.nuxt/
